    "description": "Iranian regional sweets encompass distinct confectionery traditions, from Isfahan’s gaz to Qom’s sohan and the rice-flour cookies associated with Kermanshah. Ingredients, texture, preparation and gift-giving practices offer useful ways to understand their regional identities without treating local recipes as uniform.",
